xt":"만일","x":206,"y":671,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"어댑터가","x":275,"y":670,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"MAC","x":403,"y":671,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"주소","x":488,"y":670,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"대신에","x":559,"y":669,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"네트워크","x":653,"y":669,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"계층","x":775,"y":669,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"주소를","x":840,"y":670,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"사용한다면,","x":933,"y":667,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"네트워크","x":1100,"y":671,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"계층","x":1222,"y":671,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"주소를","x":1287,"y":672,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"어탭","x":1382,"y":670,"width":54,"height":34}]},{"text":"터 RAM에 저장하고 어댑터를 이동할 때마다(또는 전원을 새로 결 때마다) 재구성해야 한다는 것","words":[{"text":"터","x":207,"y":723,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"RAM에","x":247,"y":724,"width":101,"height":31},{"text":"저장하고","x":361,"y":722,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"어댑터를","x":487,"y":722,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"이동할","x":611,"y":721,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"때마다(또는","x":706,"y":722,"width":147,"height":33},{"text":"전원을","x":864,"y":721,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"새로","x":957,"y":721,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"결","x":1025,"y":722,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"때마다)","x":1063,"y":722,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"재구성해야","x":1166,"y":723,"width":141,"height":35},{"text":"한다는","x":1317,"y":723,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"것","x":1411,"y":723,"width":26,"height":33}]},{"text":"이다. 또 다른 방법은 어댑터에서 어떤 주소도 사용하지 않고 수신한 프레임의 데이터(일반적으로","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":207,"y":775,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"또","x":287,"y":778,"width":30,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":329,"y":776,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"방법은","x":398,"y":775,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"어댑터에서","x":495,"y":773,"width":138,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":646,"y":774,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"주소도","x":711,"y":776,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"사용하지","x":805,"y":774,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"않고","x":927,"y":774,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"수신한","x":991,"y":774,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"프레임의","x":1085,"y":775,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"데이터(일반적으로","x":1209,"y":776,"width":231,"height":34}]},{"text":"는 IP 데이터그램)를 프로토콜 스택의 상위 계층으로 전달하는 것이다. 그러면 네트워크 계충은 일","words":[{"text":"는","x":206,"y":828,"width":28,"height":32},{"text":"IP","x":246,"y":830,"width":28,"height":27},{"text":"데이터그램)를","x":286,"y":828,"width":182,"height":33},{"text":"프로토콜","x":476,"y":829,"width":114,"height":31},{"text":"스택의","x":599,"y":827,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"상위","x":693,"y":827,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"계층으로","x":758,"y":827,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"전달하는","x":879,"y":827,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"것이다.","x":998,"y":827,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"그러면","x":1104,"y":829,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"네트워크","x":1199,"y":829,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"계충은","x":1319,"y":828,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"일","x":1411,"y":827,"width":26,"height":33}]},{"text":"치하는 네트워크 계층 주소를 검사한다. 이 방법의 문제점은 동일한 브로드캐스트 랜의 다른 노드","words":[{"text":"치하는","x":207,"y":880,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"네트워크","x":304,"y":881,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"계층","x":429,"y":880,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"주소를","x":496,"y":881,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"검사한다.","x":593,"y":880,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":730,"y":880,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"방법의","x":768,"y":880,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"문제점은","x":860,"y":879,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"동일한","x":981,"y":880,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"브로드캐스트","x":1075,"y":881,"width":167,"height":33},{"text":"랜의","x":1252,"y":881,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"다른","x":1319,"y":881,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"노드","x":1383,"y":882,"width":57,"height":27}]},{"text":"에게로 가는 프레임을 포함한 랜상의 모든 전송 프레임에 의해서 호스트가 인터럽트된c는 것이","words":[{"text":"에게로","x":207,"y":933,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"가는","x":305,"y":934,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"프레임을","x